MCSKIP MT,<>
MCINS %.
The insert flags say what to insert and whether to evaluate it.
MCDEF LOUD AS <BANG>
MCDEF SHOW, ; AS <name=[%WD0.] one=[%A1.] two=[%A2.] d1=[%D1.] d2=[%D2.]>
SHOW first,second;
A strips the spaces around an argument and B keeps them.
MCDEF PAIR; AS <A=[%A1.] B=[%B1.]>
PAIR   padded   ;
W inserts what was written instead of what it means.
MCDEF ECHO; AS <evaluated=[%A1.] written=[%WA1.]>
ECHO LOUD;
A null flag inserts the value of the expression itself.
MCSET P1=17
%P1. %P1+3. %-P1.
